      509   ON CHOOSE OF B-1 IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
      510   DO:
      511     assign
      512     f-d-card
      513     f-sch
      514     test-number = 1
      515     rs-dctype
      516     rs-view-mode
      517     .
      518     run test0 no-error.
